### Requests for the 4 run endpoints + health (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client).
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health: 200 if Mongo (raw + target) and Redis answer within 1 s, else 503 with the same shape
GET {{base}}/health

### Start a run over every source (202 {runId, status})
# @name startRun
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Start a run over some sources, capped and with a custom batch size
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "collections": ["restaurants", "menus"], "limit": 100, "batchSize": 50 }

### Invalid body -> 400 with Zod issue paths
POST {{base}}/runs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "collections": ["pizza"], "limit": 0 }

### The run: status, per-source progress, counters, timings, errorSample
@runId = {{startRun.response.body.runId}}
GET {{base}}/runs/{{runId}}

### Quarantined errors (cursor-paginated; limit default 50, capped at 200)
GET {{base}}/runs/{{runId}}/errors?limit=50

### ...filtered by reason
GET {{base}}/runs/{{runId}}/errors?reason=PROVIDER_ERROR&limit=200

### Resume (re-enqueue work missing from Redis). 202, or 409 if already finished, 404 if unknown
POST {{base}}/runs/{{runId}}/resume
